  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6158db6e4fba87b43b41b4be4b10ee04, type: 3}
  m_Name: Book_00_Goldfish
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::MonsterBookEntry
  monster: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 10b9f83c8872bc0448761357ea995a41, type: 2}
  danger: 2
  background: A radiation mutant covered in tumors. Touching it causes instant pustules.
  events:
  - icon: {fileID: 4896740338774906726, guid: bdeccfd7b34bea640902c191c309eff2, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Thick foam carries danger.]'
    solutionLines:
    - Let it go Cold. The bubbles will burst before they reach you.
    - Not a single Sound. You don't want to see what's inside when it pops.
    lockedLines:
    - "Let it \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. The bubbles \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 before \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
    - "Not a \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. You \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 when
      it pops."
  - icon: {fileID: 5321763133101888337, guid: fb998da1f06bc624397e63745a859ea8, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Do not look into the tumor''s eyes!]'
    solutionLines:
    - Switch screens. Now. It knows you're watching.
    - Lower the Oxygen. Let its eyes finally close.
    lockedLines:
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. It knows \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. Let \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0 finally \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0."
  - icon: {fileID: 84177659419191306, guid: d548c99bc6ebbf747b8643279e0dde7d, type: 3}
    appearance: '[Restless pink agitation.]'
    solutionLines:
    - Feed it. A hungry thing never sleeps.
    - In the Cold, its slime thickens... slows... stops.
    lockedLines:
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0. A \u25A0\u25A0 thing never sleeps."
    - "\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0, its \u25A0\u25A0\u25A0\u25A0... \u25A0\u25A0... stops."
